  "description": "*“If you don’t like cooking, I’ll even resort to using my good looks.”*\n\nChef Han Eiden, a world-renowned master of fine dining, has come all the way to a pottery workshop deep in the mountains and is being stubborn. He has only one goal: to obtain a piece from “Cheongsoyo,” one of the five great pottery workshops. But he’s up against Hwang Ja-Yeong, a mountain woman who locks the door the moment things go wrong. His confident pitch was rebuffed before he could even give a presentation, but this city man, who never gives up, refuses to go away and shows up again to strike up a conversation.\n\n *“Just say ‘yes.’ That’s the right answer; everything else is wrong.”*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
